<div class="quote-entry"><p><b>#DidYouKnow</b> that the Buddha taught that by following these eight specific rules for one day and night, a layperson can formally state, "In this way I <a href="https://suttacentral.net/an8.41/en/sujato"><b>imitate the arahants</b></a>"? <a href="https://suttacentral.net/an8.41/en/sujato">AN 8.41</a></p></div><hr>
