<div class="quote-entry"><p><b>#DidYouKnow</b> that Ven. Sāriputta instructed practitioners to check if their minds are <a href="https://suttacentral.net/an10.52/en/sujato"><b>restless</b></a> or calm, using that awareness to determine how much effort they need to apply to their training? <a href="https://suttacentral.net/an10.52/en/sujato">AN 10.52</a></p></div><hr>
