<div class="quote-entry"><p><b>#DidYouKnow</b> that the Buddha instructed those who have attained wholesome qualities to remain firmly established in them while making a further effort for the <a href="https://suttacentral.net/an10.53/en/sujato"><b>destruction of the taints</b></a>? <a href="https://suttacentral.net/an10.53/en/sujato">AN 10.53</a></p></div><hr>
