<div class="quote-entry"><p><b>#DidYouKnow</b> that the Buddha taught that a monk who possesses faith but lacks moral virtue is considered incomplete in that respect, and should actively strive to become <a href="https://suttacentral.net/an8.71/en/sujato"><b>virtuous</b></a> to fulfill his spiritual potential? <a href="https://suttacentral.net/an8.71/en/sujato">AN 8.71</a></p></div><hr>
