<div class="quote-entry"><p><b>#DidYouKnow</b> the Buddha explained that a monk who is highly learned and virtuous but cannot articulate the teachings to others is still incomplete until he becomes an effective <a href="https://suttacentral.net/an8.71/en/sujato"><b>speaker of the Dhamma</b></a>? <a href="https://suttacentral.net/an8.71/en/sujato">AN 8.71</a></p></div><hr>
