<div class="quote-entry"><p><b>#DidYouKnow</b> that the Buddha taught that a monk who is <a href="https://suttacentral.net/an6.84/en/sujato"><b>faithless</b></a> and immoral will see his progress in the Dhamma diminish as every day and night passes? <a href="https://suttacentral.net/an6.84/en/sujato">AN 6.84</a></p></div><hr>
