<div class="quote-entry"><p><b>#DidYouKnow</b> that the Buddha taught that a monk cannot realize supreme coolness if he does not <a href="https://suttacentral.net/an6.85/en/sujato"><b>gladden</b></a> the mind when it is appropriate to do so? <a href="https://suttacentral.net/an6.85/en/sujato">AN 6.85</a></p></div><hr>
