<div class="quote-entry"><p><b>#DidYouKnow</b> that the Buddha stated that people of <a href="https://suttacentral.net/sn14.17/en/sujato"><b>little learning</b></a>, who have not deeply studied or understood the teachings, will naturally associate with others who also possess very little spiritual knowledge? <a href="https://suttacentral.net/sn14.17/en/sujato">SN 14.17</a></p></div><hr>
<div class="quote-entry"><p><b>#DidYouKnow</b> that the Buddha taught that those who are <a href="https://suttacentral.net/sn14.17/en/sujato"><b>lazy</b></a> and lack spiritual effort will inevitably come together and associate with other lazy individuals who share their lack of energy? <a href="https://suttacentral.net/sn14.17/en/sujato">SN 14.17</a></p></div><hr>
