<div class="quote-entry"><p><b>#DidYouKnow</b> that <a href="https://suttacentral.net/thag20.1/en/sujato"><b>Venerable Mahā-Moggallāna</b></a> possessed the spiritual power to understand the entire world in a thousand different ways in a single moment? <a href="https://suttacentral.net/thag20.1/en/sujato">Thag 20.1</a></p></div><hr>
