<div class="quote-entry"><p><b>#DidYouKnow</b> that <a href="https://suttacentral.net/thag20.1/en/sujato"><b>Venerable Mahā-Moggallāna</b></a> had the ability to create a hundred million transformations of himself through his highly developed spiritual potency? <a href="https://suttacentral.net/thag20.1/en/sujato">Thag 20.1</a></p></div><hr>
