<div class="quote-entry"><p><b>#DidYouKnow</b> that Bhikkhuni Dantikā expressed her spiritual victory by noting that she had successfully <a href="https://suttacentral.net/thig3.4/en/sujato"><b>tamed her mind</b></a> just as a mahout tames a great elephant? <a href="https://suttacentral.net/thig3.4/en/sujato">Thig 3.4</a></p></div><hr>
