<div class="quote-entry"><p><b>#DidYouKnow</b> that Bhikkhuni Ubbirī was born into a wealthy family in Sāvatthī and was so beautiful that she was eventually chosen to be a <a href="https://suttacentral.net/thig3.5/en/sujato"><b>queen</b></a>? <a href="https://suttacentral.net/thig3.5/en/sujato">Thig 3.5</a></p></div><hr>
<div class="quote-entry"><p><b>#DidYouKnow</b> that Bhikkhuni Ubbirī was driven to extreme grief and would go to the burial ground every single day to weep following the <a href="https://suttacentral.net/thig3.5/en/sujato"><b>death of her daughter</b></a>, Jīvā? <a href="https://suttacentral.net/thig3.5/en/sujato">Thig 3.5</a></p></div><hr>
