<div class="quote-entry"><p><b>#DidYouKnow</b> that Bhikkhuni Ubbirī achieved the highest spiritual fruit of <a href="https://suttacentral.net/thig3.5/en/sujato"><b>Arahantship</b></a> immediately after contemplating the Buddha's words about the universality of death? <a href="https://suttacentral.net/thig3.5/en/sujato">Thig 3.5</a></p></div><hr>
<div class="quote-entry"><p><b>#DidYouKnow</b> that Bhikkhuni Ubbirī described her intense sorrow as a <a href="https://suttacentral.net/thig3.5/en/sujato"><b>hidden arrow</b></a> that had been lodged deep within her heart? <a href="https://suttacentral.net/thig3.5/en/sujato">Thig 3.5</a></p></div><hr>
