<div class="quote-entry"><p><b>#DidYouKnow</b> that <b>Bhikkhunī Rohiṇī</b> attained the highest liberation with the <a href="https://suttacentral.net/thig13.2/en/sujato"><b>analytical knowledges</b></a> (paṭisambhidā) shortly after joining the Order? <a href="https://suttacentral.net/thig13.2/en/sujato">Thig 13.2</a></p></div><hr>
