<div class="quote-entry"><p><b>#DidYouKnow</b> that Bhikkhuni Uttarā achieved her spiritual goal by perfectly <a href="https://suttacentral.net/thig1.15/en/sujato"><b>restraining</b></a> her body, speech, and mind? <a href="https://suttacentral.net/thig1.15/en/sujato">Thig 1.15</a></p></div><hr>
<div class="quote-entry"><p><b>#DidYouKnow</b> that Bhikkhuni Uttarā declared that she had successfully conquered <a href="https://suttacentral.net/thig1.15/en/sujato"><b>thirst</b></a> (craving) right down to its very roots? <a href="https://suttacentral.net/thig1.15/en/sujato">Thig 1.15</a></p></div><hr>
